	I am playing Unix Nethack 3.0pl9, and have the bad habit of lugging
around as much stuff as I can carry.  A bug that I have encountered with
alarming regularity occurs when I try to #loot a chest and remove objects
when I am close to my carrying capacity.  If I am too close to "you cannot
carry any more", answering "y" to the query "Remove wand of extreme annoyance"
results is a Segmentation fault.  The game then has to be blown out by the
system administrator and isn't saved, resulting in a totally wasted score.

	Just thought I could warn someone...

